        "detail": "彩叶步道 · 林间慢走",
        "art_english": "Central Green Forest Park in Tongzhou, Beijing: a broad contemporary urban forest with gently curving accessible pedestrian trails passing mixed deciduous trees, mature golden ginkgo, burnt-orange maple-like autumn foliage, fresh meadow lawns and low planted swales. Show one clear S-curving walking trail with tiny adult walkers and simple contemporary benches, a low open horizon, dense colorful tree masses and daylight. This is an ecological park landscape, no invented pagoda, no imperial palace, no red bridge or mountains, no giant art monument.",
