        "art_english": "The Greenheart Open-air Theatre immediately NORTH of the concert hall of Beijing Performing Arts Centre, alongside the canal: a clearly OPEN-AIR amphitheater integrated with gentle landscaped slopes, fan-shaped curved stepped rows of fixed seating facing a low stage, green lawn and autumn trees around the bowl. View from above one side to make the curved terraced seats and open sky legible. Restrained contemporary stage structure only; do not invent a giant permanent stadium dome or copy an indoor opera house. Keep canal-side park atmosphere and tiny adult visitors for scale.",
